  "body": "1,064m2 of THAB Zoned Land, over two Freehold Titles with two well maintained houses, on the Flat in Milford, beside Lake Pupuke\r\n\r\nThis highly desirable residential area with solid rental demand is well known for strong capital gains, and represents a high quality opportunity for land banking and investment growth or home and income potential. With a recent rezoning to THAB, this is a superb opportunity to benefit from a bounce back in the property market with enhance land values and capital growth in the short to medium term.\r\n\r\nAlso a sought-after residential area which will produce a liquid and bankable development opportunity offering substantial yield.\r\n\r\no    19 Otakau Road –     523 sqm Fee Simple, 3 bed, 1 bath\r\n\t\t\t\tRental $800.00 per week\r\n\r\no    19A Otakau Road –     541 sqm Fee Simple, 2 bed, 1 bath\r\n\t\t\t\tRental $650.00 per week\r\n\r\nMilford is a highly desirable leading North Shore Town Centre enhanced by beach and lake, with a modern shopping Centre, all easily accessible on level walking, only 9 minutes by bus or car from Auckland City. \r\n\r\nOtakau Road is in the heart of this premium location, a quiet cul-de-sac 3 minutes’ safe flat walk from Milford Town Centre, cafes, churches, shops, schools, services, and close to North Shore Hospital.\r\n\r\nThe subject properties are on the flat right beside Lake Pupuke and have a north-west facing rear aspect, drenched in all day sun. \r\n\r\nPotential for strong capital growth in the next couple of years with THAB rezoning notified on 18th August 2022.\r\n\r\nPotential for a substantial development return with either High Rise Apartments, which will result in lake, sea, and city views, or Terraced Housing. This flat rectangular block of land will require less structural build costs, resulting in a higher yield per m2\r\n\r\nAccess to Lake Pupuke and Boat Launching Ramps through Milford School.\r\n\r\nViewing by appointment.\r\n\r\nPhone owner now to secure this opportunity on (09) 486 7799 or (027) 486 7799",
